		"entry": "A wood southeast of the foot of Brekhal Varn, its moss soaked violet with mana and ringed by gems taller than a person, where the Vynakiir den, wolves whose mana has deepened into the arcane. Its name hums in v and n like the mana in its ground, with the breathy wh of the settlers' tongue; Wudhen is their word for a wood.",
